  data: {
    LLM: "Save your Jacks and 7♦ for when the floor is full of cards to maximize your capture count (Carte).\n\nBasra Hunting: If there is a single card on the table (e.g., a 6) and you hold a matching card (a 6), playing it clears the table and awards the massive 10-point Basra. Prioritize this over big sweeping captures.\n\nDefensive Discarding: If you have no capture, discard a card that is unlikely to give your opponent a Basra. For example, if you know they hold a Queen, don't discard a Queen.",
    Player: "Save your Jacks and 7♦ for when the floor is full of cards to maximize your capture count (Carte).\n\nBasra Hunting: If there is a single card on the table (e.g., a 6) and you hold a matching card (a 6), playing it clears the table and awards the massive 10-point Basra. Prioritize this over big sweeping captures.\n\nDefensive Discarding: If you have no capture, discard a card that is unlikely to give your opponent a Basra. For example, if you know they hold a Queen, don't discard a Queen.",
